CFM onboarding agent: a pending credential request is polled, not retried at once (#577)

Against Metaform/connector-fabric-manager 9aa627f38 (scripts/build-cfm-images.sh).

- agent/onboarding: REQUESTED is pending like CREATED (reschedule after 5 s);
  an unknown state is a retry error with a 30 s wait.
- pmanager/natsorchestration: handleRetryError naks with that wait when the
  activity set one; with none it naks at once, as before, so other agents
  behave unchanged.

Without it, a request that stays REQUESTED (the issuer gave up) is redelivered
as fast as the agent runs: about 30 times a second on Azure on 2026-10-06, each
with a Keycloak token, an IdentityHub call and a state write. Upstream main
still naks retry errors without a delay.

